+-----------+---------+-----------+-------------+-------------
+ t_part    | i       |     10000 |          -1 |           0
+ t_part    | a       |     10000 |         500 |           0
+ t_part    | b       |     10000 |         952 |      0.8548
+ t_part1   | i       |       500 |          -1 |           0
+ t_part1   | a       |       500 |          -1 |           0
+ t_part1   | b       |       500 |          20 |           0
